      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Different teachers may be excellent fits for different students.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Some students are preparing for auditions or advanced conservatory pathways.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Others want to:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 pl-5 list-disc text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">
